/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_5545f144_20260506_103258/review_4_attempt_1.log:137:#   arrow glyphs. The center of each glyph is still the landing cell, but the
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_5545f144_20260506_103258/review_4_attempt_1.log:142:#   2. The consumed marker at H1 carries an arrow, say "Down".
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/tmp/combo_exec_5545f144_20260506_103258/review_4_attempt_1.log:145:#   4. Therefore the same visible arrow on the marker is both a turn command
